# Citation metadata for the software and data in this repository.
#
# There is no associated publication or DOI, so there is deliberately no
# `preferred-citation`, `doi` or `identifiers` entry. Add one only when it
# exists. At each release, update `version` and `date-released`.
cff-version: 1.2.0
title: tabular-evolution-corpus
message: >-
  If you use this corpus, please cite it using the metadata in this file.
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Bozzo
    given-names: Andrea
    email: andreabozzo92@gmail.com
repository-code: https://github.com/AndreaBozzo/tabular-evolution-corpus
url: https://huggingface.co/datasets/AndreaBozzo/tabular-evolution-corpus
abstract: >-
  A small, deterministic corpus of Parquet datasets observed at two or more
  versions, with machine-checked manifests recording the complete structural
  difference between versions and row- and value-level facts that hold across
  each transition. It records objective facts, not compatibility policy, for
  use as test input by ingestion frameworks, dataframe libraries, query
  engines, schema registries and data-contract tools.
keywords:
  - schema evolution
  - parquet
  - apache arrow
  - test fixtures
  - data engineering
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-09-21
